{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t黃大仙下邨龍和樓一個單位傍晚發生火警，現已救熄，一度約100人疏散，初步無人需要送院。警方初步相信，起火原因與廚房煮食有關。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方傍晚6時許接報該單位起火，消防到場出動一喉及一煙帽隊協助灌救，至大約6時45分後將火救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:20:47.817734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:49:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T01:03:30.834745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T12:14:29.172151+00:00","content_hash":"3ddf175d69ca746b4dbd1ee8f927300230be4e3983e7f35647a89d3264230744","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}